{"kind":"action","actor":"mara","text":"I address a forward of the complete email to Eli and tap Send. ‘Oh, hang on. They aren’t asking for the two hundred and forty on top—the new payment includes forty a month to clear it. I can put in ninety for this collection, but I can’t manage an extra lump sum. I thought we meant half each when we said split. I hear you about being away, though.’"}
